    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_i_h_k_d_f_key_cache" kindref="compound">IHKDFKeyCache</ref> adapter backed by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_h_k_d_f_cache" kindref="compound">HKDFCache</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Translates <ref refid="structthemis_1_1utils_1_1_key_context" kindref="compound">KeyContext</ref> to the ikm/salt/info/length signature expected by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_h_k_d_f_cache_1ae5c177f498901a6107443351bd1a9b3e" kindref="member">HKDFCache::derive_cached()</ref>. TTL and max-size information is sourced from the <ref refid="structthemis_1_1utils_1_1_h_k_d_f_cache_config" kindref="compound">HKDFCacheConfig</ref> passed at construction time. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
